From eb6d49b036b7f787c873ce826eada3b91cfccc44 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Snitzer <snitzer@kernel.org>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 23:05:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] configs: enable the reply page recycle's KUnit tests

Build SUNRPC_REPLY_PAGES_KUNIT_TEST as a module, as the other sunrpc
suites are, so dist-srpm finds it set.

Signed-off-by: Mike Snitzer <snitzer@kernel.org>
---
 .../configs/common/generic/CONFIG_SUNRPC_REPLY_PAGES_KUNIT_TEST  | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)
 create mode 100644 redhat/configs/common/generic/CONFIG_SUNRPC_REPLY_PAGES_KUNIT_TEST

diff --git a/redhat/configs/common/generic/CONFIG_SUNRPC_REPLY_PAGES_KUNIT_TEST b/redhat/configs/common/generic/CONFIG_SUNRPC_REPLY_PAGES_KUNIT_TEST
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000..b52bb4d5cbfd3
--- /dev/null
+++ b/redhat/configs/common/generic/CONFIG_SUNRPC_REPLY_PAGES_KUNIT_TEST
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+CONFIG_SUNRPC_REPLY_PAGES_KUNIT_TEST=m
-- 
2.52.0

